36	2026-06-11 15:42:03.649933+00	25	25	\N	\N	AIRBNB_SCREENSHOT_GROUP	AIRBNB_MAIN	Reserva de grupo de Taylor en Miami - Abril 29 a Mayo 3, 2025	Reserva confirmada para grupo de 15 personas en casa junto al lago en Miami con oferta de servicios adicionales y evaluación de 3 estrellas.	Grupo de Taylor compuesto por 15 personas reservó un alojamiento en Miami para 4 noches, del 29 de abril al 3 de mayo de 2025. La propiedad es una casa frente al lago con 6 dormitorios, piscina y barbacoa, ubicada cerca de Calle 8. La llegada es el miércoles 29 de abril a las 4:00 p.m. y la salida el domingo 3 de mayo a las 10:00 a.m. El grupo recibió instrucciones detalladas para la llegada, incluyendo la entrega de un paquete de bienvenida con detalles de la propiedad, código de acceso y credenciales de WiFi, además de advertencias sobre el bloqueo de la cerradura por código incorrecto. Se solicitó actualizar los nombres de los huéspedes en la reserva para asegurar el cumplimiento con las normas. Taylor preguntó el 21 de noviembre de 2025 acerca del límite máximo de 12 huéspedes, explicando que tenían 15 alojados y consultando si era permitido; el anfitrión confirmó que no había problema en alojar al grupo completo. Se ofreció un servicio privado de shuttle con conductor profesional para facilitar el transporte del grupo dentro de Miami, con tarifas específicas para diferentes tipos de viajes: trayecto de día $400 (6 hrs), trayecto nocturno $500 (6 hrs), extra horas $100, trayecto de ida $200, transporte aeropuerto/puerto $250. La van tiene capacidad para 14 pasajeros o 10 con equipaje. En comunicación el 28 de abril, se coordinó la llegada tarde de Taylor, mientras que un primo llegaría a la hora estándar de check-in. A pesar de la buena experiencia y organización, Taylor calificó el alojamiento con 3 estrellas. La dirección del alojamiento es 9720 SW 22nd St, Miami, FL, con código de acceso 2525 y WiFi "home9720" con contraseña "Welcome1". Se indican instrucciones para desbloquear la puerta trasera y reportar problemas dentro de dos horas del check-in. El alojamiento provee elementos esenciales como papel higiénico, toallas de papel, bolsas de basura y tabletas para lavavajillas.	{260,261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272}	13	CLASSIFIED	2026-06-11 15:42:02.806+00	\N	COMPLETED	2026-06-11 15:42:02.806+00	\N	f		\N	PENDING	t	\N	PENDING	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	95.00	f	\N	f	\N	\N
40	2026-06-12 15:02:38.704703+00	29	29	\N	\N	AIRBNB_SCREENSHOT_GROUP	AIRBNB_MAIN	Taylor Group Reservation and Hosting Details - Lakefront 6BR Home Miami	Reservation confirmation and hosting details for Taylor's group of 15 guests staying April 29 to May 3, 2025, at a Lakefront 6-bedroom home near Calle 8, including check-in instructions, shuttle service offerings, and a 3-star review from Taylor.	Reservation confirmed for Taylor, Tori, and 17 others (group of 15 guests) from April 29 to May 3, 2025, at P10 L72, a Lakefront 6-bedroom home near Calle 8 with pool and BBQ. Check-in is at 4:00 p.m. on April 29, and check-out at 10:00 a.m. on May 3. Taylor expressed that they did not realize the maximum guest limit was 12 and asked if 15 guests were acceptable or if changes were needed. The host welcomed the group warmly and promised to send a welcome package at 10:00 a.m. on the arrival date with property details, access code (2525), and WiFi credentials (home9720 / Welcome1). Additional instructions included unlocking the lock at the bottom of the backyard door and reporting any problems within two hours of check-in, with minor damages exempt from reporting.\n\nThe host provided an essential stock of supplies including toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, and dishwashing pods. A private shuttle service with a professional driver was offered to ease transportation around Miami. The van accommodates 14 passengers (10 with luggage) and the pricing was provided: Day Trip $400 (6 hrs), Night Trip $500 (6 hrs), One-way $200, Airport/Port transportation $250, with extra hours $100. The shuttle service is ideal for airport pickups/drop-offs, weddings, beach trips, nights out, and group transportation. Taylor showed interest in the service and requested quotes.\n\nCommunication included reminders to inform the host of any late arrivals to ensure smooth check-in and detailed information on lock malfunction protocols. Taylor noted they personally would arrive at 9:00 p.m. while a cousin would arrive at normal check-in time and had access to arrival details. Taylor gave the accommodation a 3-star review.\n\nThroughout the conversation, the host emphasized making the stay comfortable and stress-free, with offers for premium services such as yacht rentals, massages, scooter rentals, chef’s recommendations, and event planning. The messages included translations and confirmation that the group consists of 15 people despite the earlier notice about a 12 guest limit. All messages were timestamped between March and April 2025, relevant to the reservation period.	{312,313,314,315,316,317,318,319,320,321,322,323,324}	13	CLASSIFIED	2026-06-12 15:02:35.535+00	\N	COMPLETED	2026-06-12 15:02:35.535+00	\N	f		\N	PENDING	t	\N	PENDING	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	95.00	f	\N	f	\N	\N
37	2026-06-12 13:48:23.465468+00	26	26	\N	\N	AIRBNB_SCREENSHOT_GROUP	AIRBNB_MAIN	Reservation and Communication Summary for Taylor's Airbnb Stay	Details and communications regarding the reservation of a lakefront 6-bedroom home for 15 guests from April 29 to May 3, 2025, including check-in instructions, shuttle service offerings, and guest-host interactions.	Reservation Details:\n- Guest: Taylor and group of 15 people\n- Dates: April 29 to May 3, 2025 (4 nights)\n- Property: Lakefront 6-bedroom home near Calle 8 with pool & BBQ\n- Check-in: Wednesday, April 29, 4:00 p.m.\n- Check-out: Sunday, May 3, 10:00 a.m.\n- Address: 9720 SW 22nd St, Miami, FL, 33165\n- WiFi: SSID home9720, Password Welcome1\n- Access code: 2525\n- Important: Unlock bottom lock on the backyard door\n- Essentials stocked: toilet paper (4 rolls per bathroom), paper towels (2 rolls), trash bags (10 for kitchen), dishwashing pods (min. 4)\n- Taylor gave the accommodation a 3-star review\n\nCommunications and Services:\n- Host welcomes Taylor warmly and confirms accommodation for entire group despite regulation of max 12 guests; no problem with 15 guests staying.\n- Guests were requested to update the reservation with all guests' names.\n- Host offers premium services for an elevated experience, including yacht rental, luxurious massages, chef's recommendations, event planning, scooter rentals (LuNos Riding), and a complimentary concierge service.\n- New van service available offering tours around Miami.\n- Private shuttle service offered with a professional driver, ideal for group transportation, including airport, port transfers, events, and general travel around Miami.\n- Van details: capacity for 14 passengers or 10 with luggage.\n- Price list for shuttle service (March 29, 2025):\n  * Day Trip (6 hrs): $400, extra hours $100/hr\n  * Night Trip (6 hrs): $500, extra hours $100/hr\n  * One way trip (Miami): $200\n  * Airport/Port transportation: $250\n  * Daytime: 8:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m.\n  * Nighttime: 6:00 p.m. to 12:00 a.m.\n  * Overnight (12:00 a.m. to 8:00 a.m.): price by call\n\n- Guest notified host of late arrival (Taylor arrives at 9:00 p.m., but cousin arrives at normal check-in time).\n- Host will send check-in instructions at 10:00 a.m. on arrival date including measures in case of lock malfunctions.\n- Guests advised to report any problems within two hours of check-in; minor damages do not require reporting.\n\nSummary:\nTaylor's group is confirmed to stay at the lakefront property with full support from hosts regarding guest count and transport needs. The detailed communication ensures a smooth check-in, additional services for an enhanced stay, and clear pricing and logistical information for the private shuttle service. Despite some concerns about guest limits, the host reassured no issues, and Taylor rated the accommodation with 3 stars after their stay.	{273,274,275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,284,285}	13	CLASSIFIED	2026-06-12 13:48:20.321+00	\N	COMPLETED	2026-06-12 13:48:20.321+00	\N	f		\N	PENDING	t	\N	PENDING	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	95.00	f	\N	f	\N	\N
