ed fine, and minor damages such as scratches do not need reporting. For comfort, essentials like toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, and dishwashing pods were stocked.\n\nTaylor rated the accommodation 3 stars.	{325,326,327,328,329,330,331,332,333,334,335,336,337}	13	CLASSIFIED	2026-06-18 14:13:17.161+00	\N	COMPLETED	2026-06-18 14:13:17.161+00	\N	f		\N	PENDING	t	\N	PENDING	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	95.00	f	\N	f	\N	\N
