m.\n- Night service hours: 6:00 p.m. to 12:00 a.m.\n\nCommunication:\n- Taylor noticed the booking is for 15 guests while house rules state a maximum of 12. The host confirmed accommodating the entire group is no problem.\n- Taylor will arrive late (9:00 p.m.), but a cousin will arrive at the regular check-in time with access to arrival details.\n- The host emphasized informing in advance about late arrivals to ensure smooth check-in and offered additional instructions if lock issues occur.\n\nReview:\nTaylor gave the accommodation a 3-star rating.\n\nWe are thrilled to have you and your group stay with us, and please let us know if you want to take advantage of any premium services. Thank you for choosing our property for your Miami visit!\n\nBest regards.	{208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220}	13	CLASSIFIED	2026-06-09 15:32:50.416+00	\N	COMPLETED	2026-06-09 15:32:50.416+00	\N	f		\N	PENDING	t	\N	PENDING	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	95.00	f	\N	f	\N	\N
