y, a new van service with a professional driver was available for tours around Miami. The private shuttle could accommodate the group comfortably and was ideal for airport transfers, weddings, restaurant trips, nights out, and special gatherings. Price list for the van service (with driver, capacity 14 passengers, 10 with luggage) was provided:\n- Day Trip (6 hrs): $400\n- Extra hours: $100\n- One way trip (Miami): $200\n- Airport/Port transportation: $250\n- Night Trip (6 hrs): $500\nPrices applied to specified daytime (8:00 a.m. - 6:00 p.m.) and nighttime (6:00 p.m. - midnight) hours; different pricing applies from midnight to 8:00 a.m. upon request.\n\nCommunication Highlights:\nTaylor, the reservation manager, coordinated guest updates related to arrivals, transportation inquiries, and guest count concerns. The host responded promptly, affirming arrangements and offering assistance to ensure a comfortable and organized stay.\n\nOverall, the conversation and confirmation messages established expectations for a smooth arrival and stay, with transportation and luxury add-ons available, although the group ultimately rated the accommodation with three stars.	{234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243,244,245,246}	13	CLASSIFIED	2026-06-10 13:58:37.432+00	\N	COMPLETED	2026-06-10 13:58:37.432+00	\N	f		\N	PENDING	t	\N	PENDING	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	95.00	f	\N	f	\N	\N
