988	2026-08-04 17:09:04.766373+00	1	tripadvisor	1057749641	Habana	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g147271-d263883-Reviews-Melia_Habana-Havana_Ciudad_de_la_Habana_Province_Cuba.html	Immensely grateful with cigar bar. Rafa	We have had a spectacular stay, with attention from all workers from breakfast to the level with Tatiana, Rocio Rosmery and the ladies in charge of cleaning. We are immensely grateful to everything	5	2026-04-27 00:00:00+00	2026-04-30 00:00:00+00	en	es	Ana Beatriz O	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/anabeatrizo804	2	Muchas gracias por compartir su experiencia. Nos complace saber que disfrutaron de una estancia espectacular y de la atención de nuestro equipo, especialmente en The Level y del personal de limpieza.\n\nAgradecemos mucho su reconocimiento a Tatiana, Rocío y Rosmery. Será un placer compartirlo con ellas. Saludos.	2026-05-04 00:00:00+00	Frederik Andersen	{"url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g147271-d263883-r1057749641-Habana-Havana_Ciudad_de_la_Habana_Province_Cuba.html", "type": "tripadvisor_review_search", "title": "Immensely grateful with cigar bar. Rafa", "rating": {"value": 5, "rating_max": 5, "rating_type": "Max5", "votes_count": null}, "language": "en", "position": "left", "responses": [{"text": "Muchas gracias por compartir su experiencia. Nos complace saber que disfrutaron de una estancia espectacular y de la atención de nuestro equipo, especialmente en The Level y del personal de limpieza.\\n\\nAgradecemos mucho su reconocimiento a Tatiana, Rocío y Rosmery. Será un placer compartirlo con ellas. Saludos.", "title": "Frederik Andersen", "language": "es", "timestamp": "2026-05-04 00:00:00 +00:00", "response_id": "1058995489"}], "review_id": "1057749641", "timestamp": "2026-04-27 00:00:00 +00:00", "rank_group": 18, "review_text": "We have had a spectacular stay, with attention from all workers from breakfast to the level with Tatiana, Rocio Rosmery and the ladies in charge of cleaning. We are immensely grateful to everything", "user_profile": {"url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/anabeatrizo804", "name": "Ana Beatriz O", "location": null, "image_url": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/ea/b2/default-avatar-2020-69.jpg", "reviews_count": 2}, "date_of_visit": "2026-04-30 00:00:00 +00:00", "rank_absolute": 18, "review_images": [{"url": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/33/0c/4a/ed/caption.jpg"}], "original_language": "es", "review_highlights": null}	analyzed	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	{}	{}	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	new
