1114	2026-08-17 13:47:09.641298+00	1	tripadvisor	1055020339	Habana	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g147271-d263883-Reviews-Melia_Habana-Havana_Ciudad_de_la_Habana_Province_Cuba.html	An unforgettable experience in Meliá Habana	Our recent stay in Meliá Habana has undoubtedly been one of the best experiences we have had. I want to express our sincerest thanks for all the love and attention we received, especially as we were celebrating our wedding anniversary.\n\nFrom the moment we arrived, the staff did their best to make us feel special. The surprise they prepared for us was something we will treasure forever: they made us feel that our celebration was unique and unforgettable. The room we were assigned was absolutely beautiful, with details that made it spectacular and that further elevated the magic of our stay.\n\nThe attention of the whole team was impeccable: always attentive, with a genuine smile and willing to help in every detail. The facilities are impressive, with a perfect balance between elegance and comfort, and each space invites you to enjoy and relax. The pool was a success: a super relaxing space where we could disconnect and enjoy the surroundings with total tranquility.\n\nThe dinner to celebrate our anniversary was just perfect. The decor they prepared was beautiful, with a detail that excited us a lot, and the evening itself was great, with careful attention and an atmosphere that made the night even more special. The food, on the other hand, was delicious; every bite was a pleasure and all the culinary attentions were up to the level of a first-rate service.\n\nWe are very happy and deeply grateful. It’s certainly a place we’ll come back to, because we take not only the memory of a perfect anniversary, but also the affection of a team that knows what true hospitality means.\n\nThank you so much for everything! Five well-deserved stars!	5	2026-04-01 00:00:00+00	2026-04-30 00:00:00+00	en	es	María Karla V	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profil