972	2026-08-04 17:09:04.766373+00	1	tripadvisor	1069394976	Habana	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g147271-d263883-Reviews-Melia_Habana-Havana_Ciudad_de_la_Habana_Province_Cuba.html	Automatic energy backup system and the best place with Wi-Fi connection I have ever been to.	I spent two nights from Saturday to Monday (7/18-20), and the truth is I found it very good. I was able to enjoy all the included benefits of the Meliá Rewards loyalty program, with early check-in and late check-out, and the welcome drink. If you are looking for an ideal place to rest, this is the one, as it has a very good energy backup system, it is automatic. I went with my children who loved it, they have lagoons with very beautiful fish that entertain the children. As a benefit of the place where it is located and which for me was decisive in booking it, is that it has the National Aquarium with the Festival Pa' Cuba just a few blocks away, and you can walk there. To my joy I found my English professor Orlando from the university, who was very cordial and always very concerned about the well-being of the guests. The room was clean, the TV channels could be seen well and the signal did not drop, they restock you with towels and whatever you need. The Wi-Fi connection is great. I managed to reach up to 42 Mbps connection, something never seen in any of the hotels I have been to or anywhere in Cuba. This has been the place with the best Wi-Fi connection speed. I give it 4 stars because the pool really needs renovation, and I hope that the renovation being done on the top floors soon reaches the pool as well.	4	2026-07-21 00:00:00+00	2026-07-31 00:00:00+00	en	es	yphinojosa	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/yphinojosa	16	\N	\N	\N	{"url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g147271-d263883-r1069394976-Habana-Havana_Ciudad_de_la_Habana_Province_Cuba.html", "type": "tripadvisor_review_search", "title": "Automatic energy backup system and the best place with Wi-Fi connection I have ever been to.", "rating": {"value": 4, "rating_max": 5, "rating_type": "Max5", "votes_count": null}, "language": "en", "position": "left", "responses": null, "review_id": "1069394976", "timestamp": "2026-07-21 00:00:00 +00:00", "rank_group": 2, "review_text": "I spent two nights from Saturday to Monday (7/18-20), and the truth is I found it very good. I was able to enjoy all the included benefits of the Meliá Rewards loyalty program, with early check-in and late check-out, and the welcome drink. If you are looking for an ideal place to rest, this is the one, as it has a very good energy backup system, it is automatic. I went with my children who loved it, they have lagoons with very beautiful fish that entertain the children. As a benefit of the place where it is located and which for me was decisive in booking it, is that it has the National Aquarium with the Festival Pa' Cuba just a few blocks away, and you can walk there. To my joy I found my English professor Orlando from the university, who was very cordial and always very concerned about the well-being of the guests. The room was clean, the TV channels could be seen well and the signal did not drop, they restock you with towels and whatever you need. The Wi-Fi connection is great. I managed to reach up to 42 Mbps connection, something never seen in any of the hotels I have been to or anywhere in Cuba. This has been the place with the best Wi-Fi connection speed. I give it 4 stars because the pool really needs renovation, and I hope that the renovation being done on the top floors soon reaches the pool as well.", "user_profile": {"url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/yphinojosa", "name": "yphinojosa", "location": "Pinar del Rio, Cuba", "image_url": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/2b/17/11/01/yphinojosa.jpg", "reviews_count": 16}, "date_of_visit": "2026-07-31 00:00:00 +00:00", "rank_absolute": 2, "review_images": null, "original_language": "es", "review_highlights": [{"feature": "Value", "assessment": "4"}, {"feature": "Rooms", "assessment": "4"}, {"feature": "Location", "assessment": "5"}, {"feature": "Cleanliness", "assessment": "4"}, {"feature": "Service", "assessment": "4"}, {"feature": "Sleep Quality", "assessment": "5"}]}	failed	2026-08-14 14:02:03.288+00	\N	\N	Muy positivo	Media	{"Servicios del hotel",Instalaciones,"Atención al cliente","Programa de lealtad",Wi-Fi}	{"Programa de lealtad Meliá Rewards","energía de respaldo",ubicación,"conexión Wi-Fi"}	{"necesidad de renovación de la piscina"}	Satisfacción	Alta	El huésped tuvo una experiencia muy positiva debido a los beneficios del programa de lealtad Meliá Rewards y el excelente sistema de energía de respaldo. Destacó la ubicación del hotel cerca del Acuario Nacional y la velocidad de la conexión Wi-Fi. Sin embargo, mencionó que la piscina necesita renovación.	2026-08-14 14:02:16.67+00	\N	in_review
977	2026-08-04 17:09:04.766373+00	1	tripadvisor	1061674737	Habana	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g147271-d263883-Reviews-Melia_Habana-Havana_Ciudad_de_la_Habana_Province_Cuba.html	Incredible experience in Havana	I stayed 2 nights in the hotel with a group of friends and was amazing the structure of the hotel. There is a boulevard with several restaurants, a cigar shop, a cafeteria, a garden that gives the impression that we are in a park. Beautiful.\nBesides the pool which is huge, clean, with a wet bar and overlooking the sea. \nThe hotel is further away from the historic center but is in a super quiet region and close to a street where there are several bars/restaurants.\nManager Negrin is always present to ensure everything is perfect and is a loved one.\nThe manha cafe is full and the attendants are kind.  \nThe apartments are spacious, clean, have coffee in capsule, sea view. Top!\nI'd definitely come back.	5	2026-05-25 00:00:00+00	2026-05-31 00:00:00+00	en	pt	Guide63662459519	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Guide63662459519	2	Muito obrigado pela sua avaliação! Ficamos felizesque tenha aproveitado a nossa piscina, os restaurants e a atenção da nossa equipe. Transmitiremos o seu logio ao nosso gerente Negrín. Esperamos recebê-lo nvamente em breve!	2026-05-26 00:00:00+00	Frederik Andersen	{"url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g147271-d263883-r1061674737-Habana-Havana_Ciudad_de_la_Habana_Province_Cuba.html", "type": "tripadvisor_review_search", "title": "Incredible experience in Havana", "rating": {"value": 5, "rating_max": 5, "rating_type": "Max5", "votes_count": null}, "language": "en", "position": "left", "responses": [{"text": "Muito obrigado pela sua avaliação! Ficamos felizesque tenha aproveitado a nossa piscina, os restaurants e a atenção da nossa equipe. Transmitiremos o seu logio ao nosso gerente Negrín. Esperamos recebê-lo nvamente em breve!", "title": "Frederik Andersen", "language": "pt", "timestamp": "2026-05-26 00:00:00 +