982	2026-08-04 17:09:04.766373+00	1	tripadvisor	1060137706	Habana	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g147271-d263883-Reviews-Melia_Habana-Havana_Ciudad_de_la_Habana_Province_Cuba.html	The Privilege of Feeling at Home	There is a very specific form of luxury that does not relate to the shine of materials, but to memory and consistency. Returning to the Meliá Habana year after year is to experience that relief of knowing that, upon crossing its doors, everything will be exactly where it should be.\nWhat defines a "home" away from home is the staff. It is not just the efficiency in check-in or the cleanliness of the service; it is the feeling that your presence is valued. In an environment where everything changes, finding that technical and human hospitality that welcomes you with the same level of professionalism year after year is a rare luxury. It is a place where you are not just a room number, but a returning resident.\nThe Meliá Habana does not try to be the trendiest or the most avant-garde hotel; I feel it prefers to be the most welcoming. It is the refuge for the professional seeking efficiency and for the traveler seeking peace. After so many years, it continues to demonstrate that true supremacy lies not in novelty, but in sustained excellence over time.\nIt is, without a doubt, the place where Havana becomes predictable in the best sense: that of absolute comfort.	5	2026-05-14 00:00:00+00	2026-05-31 00:00:00+00	en	es	JRey2014	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/JRey2014	225	Muchas gracias por compartir su experiencia en  Meliá Habana. Leer sus palabras nos llena de orgullo y, al mismo tiempo, nos recuerda el popósito más profundo de nuestro trabajo: hacer que cada huésped sienta que regresa a casa.\n\nHasta su próximo regreso, que esperamos sea muy pronto. Saludos.\n	2026-05-20 00:00:00+00	Frederik Andersen	{"url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g147271-d263883-r1060137706-Habana-Havana_Ciudad_de_la_Habana_Province_Cuba.html", "type": "tripadvisor_review_search", "title": "The Privilege of Feeling at Home", "rating": {"value": 5, "rating_max": 5, "rating_type": "Max5", "votes_count": null}, "language": "en", "position": "left", "responses": [{"text": "Muchas gracias por compartir su experiencia en  Meliá Habana. Leer sus palabras nos llena de orgullo y, al mismo tiempo, nos recuerda el popósito más profundo de nuestro trabajo: hacer que cada huésped sienta que regresa a casa.\\n\\nHasta su próximo regreso, que esperamos sea muy pronto. Saludos.\\n", "title": "Frederik Andersen", "language": "es", "timestamp": "2026-05-20 00:00:00 +00:00", "response_id": "1060981652"}], "review_id": "1060137706", "timestamp": "2026-05-14 00:00:00 +00:00", "rank_group": 12, "review_text": "There is a very specific form of luxury that does not relate to the shine of materials, but to memory and consistency. Returning to the Meliá Habana year after year is to experience that relief of knowing that, upon crossing its doors, everything will be exactly where it should be.\\nWhat defines a \\"home\\" away from home is the staff. It is not just the efficiency in check-in or the cleanliness of the service; it is the feeling that your presence is valued. In an environment where everything changes, finding that technical and human hospitality that welcomes you with the same level of professionalism year after year is a rare luxury. It is a place where you are not just a room number, but a returning resident.\\nThe Meliá Habana does not try to be the trendiest or the most avant-garde hotel; I feel it prefers to be the most welcoming. It is the refuge for the professional seeking efficiency and for the traveler seeking peace. After so many years, it continues to demonstrate that true supremacy lies not in novelty, but in sustained excellence over time.\\nIt is, without a doubt, the place where Havana becomes predictable in the best sense: that of absolute comfort.", "user_profile": {"url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/JRey2014", "name": "JRey2014", "location": "La Coruna, Spain", "image_url": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/0e/c0/80/d3/jrey2014.jpg", "reviews_count": 225}, "date_of_visit": "2026-05-31 00:00:00 +00:00", "rank_absolute": 12, "review_images": null, "original_language": "es", "review_highlights": [{"feature": "Value", "assessment": "5"}, {"feature": "Rooms", "assessment": "5"}, {"feature": "Location", "assessment": "4"}, {"feature": "Cleanliness", "assessment": "5"}, {"feature": "Service", "assessment": "5"}, {"feature": "Sleep Quality", "assessment": "4"}]}	failed	2026-08-18 16:10:18.123+00	\N	\N	very_positive	low	{staff_service,cleanliness,check_in,comfort}	{"Excelente servicio del personal","Eficiencia en el check-in",Limpieza,"Constancia en la calidad del servicio"}	{}	satisfaction	very_high	El huésped expresa gran satisfacción y señala que el Meliá Habana se siente como un hogar lejos del hogar. Aprecia la hospitalidad técnica y humana que recibe cada año, así como la eficiencia del check-in y la limpieza del servicio.	2026-08-18 16:30:46.314+00	\N	in_review
1113	2026-08-17 13:47:09.641298+00	1	tripadvisor	1055038137	Habana	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g147271-d263883-Reviews-Melia_Habana-Havana_Ciudad_de_la_Habana_Province_Cuba.html	The Cuban Beauty (Japanese restaurant)	Congratulations to chef Jorge Ortiz, very good food, I don’t usually eat anything from the sea because I don’t like it and less the raw fish, which was just one of the dishes he presented me and I really have to say that it tasted good, even the texture, which is contradictory for me because I’m not used to it, I liked it.	5	2026-04-01 00:00:00+00	2026-03-31 00:00:00+00	en	es	Traveler56323814086	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Traveler56323814086	1	Muchas gracias por compartir su experiencia. Nos complace saber que disfrutó de la propuesta culinaria y, en especial, de la atención del chef Jorge Ortiz.\n\nSerá un placer hacerle llegar su felicitación y su reconocimiento. Saludos.	2026-04-14 00:00:00+00	Frederik Andersen	{"url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g147271-d263883-r1055038137-Habana-Havana_Ciudad_de_la_Habana_Province_Cuba.html", "type": "tripadvisor_review_search", "title": "The Cuban Beauty (Japanese restaurant)", "rating": {"value": 5, "rating_max": 5, "rating_type": "Max5", "votes_count": null}, "language": "en", "position": "left", "responses": [{"text": "Muchas gracias por compartir su experiencia. Nos complace saber que disfrutó de la propuesta culinaria y, en especial, de la atención del chef Jorge Ortiz.\\n\\nSerá un placer hacerle llegar su felicitación y su reconocimiento. Saludos.", "title": "Frederik Andersen", "language": "es", "timestamp": "2026-04-14 00:00:00 +00:00", "response_id": "1056580972"}], "review_id": "1055038137", "timestamp": "2026-04-01 00:00:00 +00:00", "rank_group": 23, "review_text": "Congratulations to chef Jorge Ortiz, very good food, I don’t usually eat anything from the sea because I don’t like it and less the raw fish, which was just one of the dishes he presented me and I really have to say that it tasted good, even the texture, which is contradictory for me because I’m not used to it, I liked it.", "user_profile": {"url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Traveler56323814086", "name": "Traveler56323814086", "location": null, "image_url": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f4/5d/default-avatar-2020-32.jpg", "reviews_count": 1}, "date_of_visit": "2026-03-31 00:00:00 +00:00", "rank_absolute": 23, "review_images": null, "original_language": "es", "review_highlights": [{"feature": "Rooms", "assessment": "4"}, {"feature": "Location", "assessment": "5"}, {"feature": "Cleanliness", "assessment": "5"}, {"feature": "Service", "assessment": "4"}, {"feature": "Sleep Quality", "assessment": "5"}]}	analyzed	2026-08-23 19:52:58.321+00	\N	\N	very_positive	low	{food_beverage,staff_service}	{"Excelente comida preparada por el chef Jorge Ortiz"}	{}	satisfaction	very_high	El huésped elogia la comida (especialmente el pescado crudo) preparada por el chef Jorge Ortiz, a pesar de que no suele comer productos del mar.	2026-08-23 19:53:12.54+00	\N	in_review
971	2026-08-04 17:09:04.766373+00	1	tripadvisor	1070334967	Habana	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g147271-d263883-Reviews-Melia_Habana-Havana_Ciudad_de_la_Habana_Province_Cuba.html	Hotel without air conditioning, food in bad condition, terrible solutions... in short.... A horror movie	The hotel is a disaster, the air conditioning doesn't work even in the rooms, the food is horrible (lack of refrigeration, little variety, cold coffee and warm juices, not to mention that there is no air conditioning and that the restaurant is also full of flies, a disaster) in addition to the fact that they cannot agree on how to tell lies, since the night before I reported that the air conditioning was not working, in the morning I get up and go to the public relations department to complain after having contacted my agency, everyone at the hotel knew that the air conditioning was not working, and while sitting there they called from my agency to the front desk to ask if it was true that they had climate control problems to which the receptionist stated that the climate control was working perfectly, then I receive the message from the travel agency telling me this and while sitting there I confront them and they tell me that the receptionist did not have that information, which she clearly did have since she made a key for me the day before to see another room that had the same problem, it is a disaster as a hotel and honestly they should coordinate better to tell lies, but mainly they should stop playing with the guests' departures, it is preferable that they tell the guest that they have broken equipment or whatever and that they should go to another hotel, rather than having them wait like a fool there and laughing at them..... Just to highlight something, Carlos who brings room service is very kind, as is the maintenance guy, and the cleaning ladies who assisted me were more than pleasant, it is the only good thing I take away from that hotel, I hope they know how to value the staff they have more, instead of having them working in subhuman conditions….. one last thing to highlight, they brought me a fan at the last minute so it would blow air on me ….. a shame that they cut the electricity every 5 min …. I find the solution pathetic….	1	2026-07-27 00:00:00+00	2026-07-31 00:00:00+00	en	es	Raydel C	https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/raydelc2025	4	\N	\N	\N	{"url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g147271-d263883-r1070334967-Habana-Havana_Ciudad_de_la_Habana_Province_Cuba.html", "type": "tripadvisor_review_search", "title": "Hotel without air conditioning, food in bad condition, terrible solutions... in short.... A horror movie", "rating": {"value": 1, "rating_max": 5, "rating_type": "Max5", "votes_count": null}, "language": "en", "position": "left", "responses": null, "review_id": "1070334967", "timestamp": "2026-07-27 00:00:00 +00:00", "rank_group": 1, "review_text": "The hotel is a disaster, the air conditioning doesn't work even in the rooms, the food is horrible (lack of refrigeration, little variety, cold coffee and warm juices, not to mention that there is no air conditioning and that the restaurant is also full of flies, a disaster) in addition to the fact that they cannot agree on how to tell lies, since the night before I reported that the air conditioning was not working, in the morning I get up and go to the public relations department to complain after having contacted my agency, everyone at the hotel knew that the air conditioning was not working, and while sitting there they called from my agency to the front desk to ask if it was true that they had climate control problems to which the receptionist stated that the climate control was working perfectly, then I receive the message from the travel agency telling me this and while sitting there I confront them and they tell me that the receptionist did not have that information, which she clearly did have since she made a key for me the day before to see anot