 "2026-07-27T00:00:00+00:00", "evidenceText": "no air conditioning ... they brought me a fan at the last minute ... a shame that they cut the electricity every 5 min", "reviewerName": "Raydel C", "subcauseCode": "HOTEL_ROOM_COMFORT_TEMP", "findingSummary": "Room temperature comfort is poor due to lack of air conditioning and frequent electricity cuts."}, {"id": 937, "rating": 4, "areaCode": "HOTEL_TECHNOLOGY", "priority": "high", "reviewId": 972, "causeCode": null, "sentiment": "positive", "reviewDate": "2026-07-21T00:00:00+00:00", "evidenceText": "The TV channels could be seen well and the signal did not drop ... The Wi-Fi connection is great. I managed to reach up to 42 Mbps connection, something never seen in any of the hotels I have been to or anywhere in Cuba.", "reviewerName": "yphinojosa", "subcauseCode": null, "findingSummary": "Excellent Wi-Fi connection with high speed and stable signal"}, {"id": 938, "rating": 4, "areaCode": "HOTEL_FACILITIES", "priority": "high", "reviewId": 972, "causeCode": "HOTEL_FAC_POOL", "sentiment": "negative", "reviewDate": "2026-07-21T00:00:00+00:00", "evidenceText": "I give it 4 stars because the pool really needs renovation, and I hope that the renovation being done on the top floors soon reaches the pool as well.", "reviewerName": "yphinojosa", "subcauseCode": null, "findingSummary": "Pool requires renovation"}, {"id": 934, "rating": 1, "areaCode": "HOTEL_SERVICE", "priority": "medium", "reviewId": 971, "causeCode": null, "sentiment": "positive", "reviewDate": "2026-07-27T00:00:00+00:00", "evidenceText": "Carlos who brings room service is very kind, as is the maintenance guy, and the cleaning ladies who assisted me were more than pleasant", "reviewerName": "Raydel C", "subcauseCode": null, "findingSummary": "Staff including room service, maintenance, and cleaning were kind and pleasant."}, {"id": 935, "rating": 4, "areaCode": "HOTEL_SERVICE", "priority": "medium", "reviewId": 972, "causeCode": null, "sentiment": "positive", "reviewDate": "2026-07-21T00:00:00+00:00", "evidenceText": "I was able to enjoy all the included benefits of the Meliá Rewards loyalty program, with early check-in and late check-out, and the welcome drink. ... I found my English professor Orlando from the university, who was very cordial and always very concerned about the well-being of the guests.", "reviewerName": "yphinojosa", "subcauseCode": null, "findingSummary": "Good service including loyalty benefits and cordial staff"}, {"id": 936, "rating": 4, "areaCode": "HOTEL_ROOMS", "priority": "medium", "reviewId": 972, "causeCode": "HOTEL_ROOM_CLEANLINESS", "sentiment": "positive", "reviewDate": "2026-07-21T00:00:00+00:00", "evidenceText": "The room was clean ... they restock you with towels and whatever you need.", "reviewerName": "yphinojosa", "subcauseCode": null, "findingSummary": "Room was clean and towels were restocked as needed"}], "entityName": "Melia Habana", "generatedAt": "2026-08-05T16:40:31.571Z", "reviewCount": 2, "findingCount": 9, "recommendations": ["Proporcionar a los equipos de mantenimiento y limpieza los recursos necesarios para mantener todas las instalaciones en condiciones óptimas.", "Implementar una formación regular y consistente para el personal de atención al cliente para mejorar la comunicación y la resolución de problemas.", "Revisar los protocolos de preparación y almacenamiento de alimentos para mejorar la calidad de la comida servida, incluyendo la refrigeración adecuada y el control de plagas."], "executiveSummary": "El informe abarca el periodo desde el 07 de julio al 05 de agosto de 2026. Se han detectado varios problemas de alta prioridad en el hotel Meliá Habana, que incluyen fallas en el aire acondicionado, cuestiones de calidad con la comida y una comunicación deficiente desde recepción. Sin embargo, también hay áreas en las que el hotel está destacando, específicamente la conexión WiFi, y la calidad del servicio y limpieza de las habitaciones.", "synchronizedUntil": "2026-07-08T15:34:00.383+00:00", "positiveHighlights": [{"title": "Conexión Wi-Fi excelente", "summary": "La conexión Wi-Fi del hotel es excelente, con una señal de alta velocidad y estable.", "evidence": ["The TV channels could be seen well and the signal did not drop ... The Wi-Fi connection is great. I managed to reach up to 42 Mbps connection, something never seen in any of the hotels I have been to or anywhere in Cuba."]}, {"title": "Servicio de calidad", "summary": "El personal, incluyendo el servicio de habitaciones, mantenimiento y limpieza, es amable y agradable. Los huéspedes han destacado el buen servicio y los beneficios de lealtad.", "evidence": ["Carlos who brings room service is very kind, as is the maintenance guy, and the cleaning ladies who assisted me were more than pleasant", "I was able to enjoy all the included benefits of the Meliá Rewards loyalty program, with early check-in and late check-out, and the welcome drink. ... I found my English professor Orlando from the university, who was very cordial and always very concerned about the well-being of the guests."]}, {"title": "Habitaciones limpias", "summary": "Las habitaciones están limpias y las toallas se repone según sea necesario.", "evidence": ["The room was clean ... they restock you with towels and whatever you need."]}], "operationalPriorities": [{"title": "Problemas de mantenimiento en las habitaciones", "impact": "Afecta significativamente la comodidad y satisfacción de los huéspedes durante su estancia.", "summary": "Los sistemas de aire acondicionado en las habitaciones no funcionan de manera eficaz.", "areaCode": "HOTEL_ROOMS", "evidence": ["the air conditioning doesn't work even in the rooms"], "priority": "high", "causeCode": "HOTEL_ROOM_MAINTENANCE", "recommendedAction": "Revisar y reparar los sistemas de aire acondicionado en las habitaciones para asegurar su correcto funcionamiento."}, {"title": "Calidad deficiente de los alimentos y bebidas", "impact": "Desmejora la experiencia de la comida en el hotel y puede afectar la salud de los huéspedes.", "summary": "La calidad de los alimentos es pobre, con falta de refrigeración, poca variedad, café frío, jugos calientes y presencia de moscas en el restaurante.", "areaCode": "HOTEL_FOOD_BEVERAGE", "evidence": ["the food is horrible (lack of refrigeration, little variety, cold coffee and warm juices, not to mention that ... the restaurant is also full of flies)"], "priority": "high", "causeCode": "HOTEL_FOOD_QUALITY", "recommendedAction": "Mejorar el control de calidad de los alimentos y la refrigeración, e incrementar las medidas de higiene en el restaurante para evitar la presencia de moscas."}, {"title": "Atención deficiente en la recepción", "impact": "Causa confusión y frustración en los huéspedes, lo que disminuye su satisfacción global con el hotel.", "summary": "El personal de recepción proporcionó información contradictoria sobre los problemas de aire acondicionado y mostró una mala resolución de problemas.", "areaCode": "HOTEL_FRONT_OFFICE", "evidence": ["receptionist stated that the climate control was working perfectly ... then ... they tell me that the receptionist did not have that information ... it is a disaster as a hotel ... they should stop playing with the guests' departures"], "priority": "high", "causeCode": "HOTEL_FRONT_ATTENTION", "recommendedAction": "Proporcionar formación al personal de recepción en comunicación efectiva y resolución de problemas."}, {"title": "Mantenimiento necesario en la piscina", "impact": "Puede afectar la percepción de los huéspedes sobre las instalaciones del hotel y desincentivar el uso de la piscina.", "summary": "La piscina requiere de renovación.", "areaCode": "HOTEL_FACILITIES", "evidence": ["I give it 4 stars because the pool really needs renovation, and I hope that the renovation being done on the top floors soon reaches the pool as well."], "priority": "high", "causeCode": "HOTEL_FAC_POOL", "recommendedAction": "Planificar y realizar una renovación de la piscina para mejorar su apariencia y funcionalidad."}]}	2026-08-05 16:40:43.789186+00
