d cleaning were kind and pleasant."}, {"id": 935, "rating": 4, "areaCode": "HOTEL_SERVICE", "priority": "medium", "reviewId": 972, "causeCode": null, "sentiment": "positive", "reviewDate": "2026-07-21T00:00:00+00:00", "evidenceText": "I was able to enjoy all the included benefits of the Meliá Rewards loyalty program, with early check-in and late check-out, and the welcome drink. ... I found my English professor Orlando from the university, who was very cordial and always very concerned about the well-being of the guests.", "reviewerName": "yphinojosa", "subcauseCode": null, "findingSummary": "Good service including loyalty benefits and cordial staff"}, {"id": 936, "rating": 4, "areaCode": "HOTEL_ROOMS", "priority": "medium", "reviewId": 972, "causeCode": "HOTEL_ROOM_CLEANLINESS", "sentiment": "positive", "reviewDate": "2026-07-21T00:00:00+00:00", "evidenceText": "The room was clean ... they restock you with towels and whatever you need.", "reviewerName": "yphinojosa", "subcauseCode": null, "findingSummary": "Room was clean and towels were restocked as needed"}, {"id": 943, "rating": 5, "areaCode": "HOTEL_SERVICE", "priority": "medium", "reviewId": 974, "causeCode": null, "sentiment": "positive", "reviewDate": "2026-06-11T00:00:00+00:00", "evidenceText": "Very professional and warm treatment at the same time. Quality service.", "reviewerName": "valdes gonzalez t", "subcauseCode": null, "findingSummary": "Professional and warm treatment with quality service"}, {"id": 944, "rating": 5, "areaCode": "HOTEL_FOOD_BEVERAGE", "priority": "medium", "reviewId": 974, "causeCode": "HOTEL_FOOD_RESTAURANT", "sentiment": "positive", "reviewDate": "2026-06-11T00:00:00+00:00", "evidenceText": "I also enjoyed the original dishes at the La Bella Cubana restaurant", "reviewerName": "valdes gonzalez t", "subcauseCode": null, "findingSummary": "Enjoyed original dishes at the restaurant"}, {"id": 948, "rating": 5, "areaCode": "HOTEL_FOOD_BEVERAGE", "priority": "medium", "reviewId": 976, "c