s ha sido mayoritariamente positiva, según lo expresado en las opiniones recibidas. No obstante, dado el número reducido de opiniones y hallazgos, cualquier interpretación sobre tendencias o patrones debe realizarse con especial cautela.", "synchronizedUntil": "2026-07-08T15:34:00.383+00:00", "methodologicalNote": "Este informe sintetiza las opiniones y hallazgos de huéspedes correspondientes al período analizado. La interpretación de los resultados debe hacerse considerando tanto la cantidad como la naturaleza de la evidencia disponible. La valoración y toma de decisiones respecto a los puntos expuestos corresponde en exclusiva a la dirección del establecimiento.", "positiveHighlights": [{"title": "Servicio excepcional y atención personalizada del personal", "summary": "Diversos testimonios resaltan la dedicación y el trato destacado del personal, quienes supieron ofrecer un servicio atento y personalizado, generando experiencias memorables para los huéspedes.", "evidence": ["the staff did their best to make us feel special. The surprise they prepared for us was something we will treasure forever: they made us feel that our celebration was unique and unforgettable. The attention of the whole team was impeccable: always attentive, with a genuine smile and willing to help in every detail."]}, {"title": "Experiencias gastronómicas positivas y servicio en restaurante", "summary": "Se valora positivamente el servicio y la calidad en los restaurantes del hotel, destacando especialmente la atención en celebraciones y la creatividad de las propuestas culinarias.", "evidence": ["The dinner to celebrate our anniversary was just perfect. The decor they prepared was beautiful, with a detail that excited us a lot, and the evening itself was great, with careful attention and an atmosphere that made the night even more special.", "the restaurants offer five-star service", "I also enjoyed the original dishes at the La Bella Cubana restaurant", "We visited the restaurant La Bella Cubana, excellent service, especially the creations of Chef Jorge Ortiz; congratulations to him, he is the best."]}, {"title": "Experiencia global altamente satisfactoria", "summary": "Varias opiniones coinciden en describir la estancia como memorable y de gran calidad, resaltando la voluntad de repetir la experiencia en el futuro.", "evidence": ["Our recent stay in Meliá Habana has undoubtedly been one of the best experiences we have had. ... It’s certainly a place we’ll come back to, because we take not only the memory of a perfect anniversary, but also the affection of a team that knows what true hospitality means.", "Spectacular. The best of vat certainly. 5 STARS ++", "My stay at the Meliá Habana was simply exceptional. Thank you to the whole team for making our visit an unforgettable experience. We definitely keep coming back and recommending!!!", "Without a doubt, a very good experience as a new customer, would repeat."]}, {"title": "Calidad y confort de las habitaciones", "summary": "Se aprecia en varias menciones la comodidad, limpieza, amplitud y el atractivo de las habitaciones, así como la preparación para asegurar una estancia confortable.", "evidence": ["The room we were assigned was absolutely beautiful, with details that made it spectacular and that further elevated the magic of our stay.", "The room was very clean and well maintained and prepared for a comfortable stay.", "The apartments are spacious, clean, have coffee in capsule, sea view.", "The room was beautiful, with details that made it spectacular."]}, {"title": "Piscinas y zonas de esparcimiento", "summary": "La zona de la piscina es mencionada por su ambiente relajante, limpieza, tamaño y las vistas, contribuyendo notablemente al disfrute de la estadía.", "evidence": ["The pool was a success: a super relaxing space where we could disconnect and enjoy the surroundings with total tranquility.", "the relaxed atmosphere of the pool", "the pool which is huge, clean, with a wet bar and overlooking the sea.", "The super relaxing pool, ideal for disconnecting."]}, {"title": "Limpieza destacada en habitaciones y áreas comunes", "summary": "Las tareas de limpieza reciben múltiples elogios por parte de los huéspedes, quienes aprecian ambientes cuidados y agradables tanto en habitaciones como en zonas comunes.", "evidence": ["the maids leave the rooms sparkling", "pleasant and clean environment", "very clean everything, both common areas and room, cleaning"]}, {"title": "Atención cálida y profesional en la recepción y dirección", "summary": "Distintas menciones resaltan la calidad humana y profesionalidad tanto del personal de recepción como de la gerencia, con atención cercana y personalizada.", "evidence": ["all the staff provide attentive service at the reception. The treatment is incredible; they make you feel like family all the time. Amparo at the reception was very attentive, always aware of all our needs, and with a smile, she was always ready to ensure we had a great stay.", "Very professional and warm treatment at the same time.", "Manager Negrin is always present to ensure everything is perfect and is a loved one."]}, {"title": "Variedad y calidad en la oferta gastronómica", "summary": "Varios testimonios coinciden en la calidad y diversidad de la comida tanto en restaurantes como en los desayunos, destacando la atención de los equipos y la satisfacción general.", "evidence": ["The food, on the other hand, was delicious; every bite was a pleasure and all the culinary attentions were up to the level of a first-rate service.", "exquisite menu", "very good food, I don’t usually eat anything from the sea because I don’t like it and less the raw fish, which was just one of the dishes he presented me and I really have to say that it tasted good, even the texture, which is contradictory for me because I’m not used to it, I liked it.", "delicious food."]}, {"title": "Instalaciones e infraestructuras valoradas positivamente", "summary": "Se destacan el buen estado, la elegancia, comodidad y la variedad de servicios e instalaciones, incluidas las áreas verdes y de descanso.", "evidence": ["The facilities are impressive, with a perfect balance between elegance and comfort, and each space invites you to enjoy and relax.", "the facilities are impeccable", "a garden that gives the impression that we are in a park. Beautiful.", "Excellent facilities"]}, {"title": "Ubicación tranquila y conveniente", "summary": "La ubicación del hotel se percibe mayormente positiva, destacando tranquilidad y buena conectividad con zonas de interés.", "evidence": ["The hotel is further away from the historic center but is in a super quiet region and close to a street where there are several bars/restaurants.", "a good location 👌"]}, {"title": "Otros servicios y comodidades bien valorados", "summary": "Se aprecian servicios adicionales como el spa, bares y la atención en la cafetería, que contribuyen a la percepción de una oferta variada y completa.", "evidence": ["the massage services", "Yaima from the coffee shop 24/7.", "The hotel is very complete, organized, has several restaurants and bars in its interior, making the tourist have everything very close."]}], "operationalPriorities": [{"title": "Observación puntual sobre la actitud del personal de recepción", "summary": "Se recogió una opinión aislada que señala que el trato del personal de recepción no fue amistoso. Se trata de una incidencia puntual y no se observa evidencia adicional al respecto en esta muestra.", "areaCode": "HOTEL_FRONT_OFFICE", "evidence": ["Sorry, not friendly"], "priority": "high", "causeCode": "HOTEL_FRONT_ATTENTION"}, {"title": "Observación individual sobre el estado de las instalaciones", "summary": "Una opinión específica menciona que las instalaciones del hotel son antiguas. No se encontraron más menciones al respecto en las opiniones analizadas.", "areaCode": "HOTEL_FACILITIES", "evidence": ["old facilities"], "priority": "medium", "causeCode": null}, {"title": "C