isfacción y deseo de volver.", "evidence": ["Our recent stay in Meliá Habana has undoubtedly been one of the best experiences we have had. ... It’s certainly a place we’ll come back to, because we take not only the memory of a perfect anniversary, but also the affection of a team that knows what true hospitality means."]}, {"title": "Habitaciones cómodas y bien ambientadas", "summary": "Las habitaciones han sido calificadas como bellas, confortables y con detalles que realzaron la estancia.", "evidence": ["The room we were assigned was absolutely beautiful, with details that made it spectacular and that further elevated the magic of our stay."]}, {"title": "Área de piscina relajante", "summary": "Las áreas de piscina han sido valoradas como espacios relajantes y adecuados para el descanso.", "evidence": ["The pool was a success: a super relaxing space where we could disconnect and enjoy the surroundings with total tranquility."]}, {"title": "Calidad gastronómica muy bien valorada", "summary": "Varios comentarios destacan la calidad y sabor de la comida, con especial mención a los menús y la atención de los restaurantes.", "evidence": ["The food, on the other hand, was delicious; every bite was a pleasure and all the culinary attentions were up to the level of a first-rate service."]}, {"title": "Instalaciones elegantes y confortables", "summary": "Las instalaciones han sido descritas como elegantes, cómodas y pensadas para la relajación.", "evidence": ["The facilities are impressive, with a perfect balance between elegance and comfort, and each space invites you to enjoy and relax."]}, {"title": "Espacios comunes y jardines bien mantenidos", "summary": "Las áreas comunes y los jardines recibieron comentarios muy positivos respecto a su limpieza y mantenimiento.", "evidence": ["the facilities are impeccable", "a garden that gives the impression that we are in a park. Beautiful."]}, {"title": "Oferta de restaurantes y creatividad culinaria", "summary": "Se destacan los restaurantes y la creatividad del chef, así como el servicio brindado en estos espacios.", "evidence": ["the restaurants offer five-star service", "I also enjoyed the original dishes at the La Bella Cubana restaurant", "We visited the restaurant La Bella Cubana, excellent service, especially the creations of Chef Jorge Ortiz; congratulations to him, he is the best."]}, {"title": "Limpieza sobresaliente del hotel", "summary": "La limpieza tanto en habitaciones como áreas comunes fue valorada muy positivamente.", "evidence": ["the maids leave the rooms sparkling", "pleasant and clean environment", "very clean everything, both common areas and room, cleaning"]}, {"title": "Recepción atenta y profesional", "summary": "Diversos comentarios señalan la profesionalidad y calidez del personal de recepción, así como la actitud atenta de la gerencia.", "evidence": ["all the staff provide attentive service at the reception. The treatment is incredible; they make you feel like family all the time. Amparo at the reception was very attentive, always aware of all our needs, and with a smile, she was always ready to ensure we had a great stay.", "Very professional and warm treatment at the same time.", "Manager Negrin is always present to ensure everything is perfect and is a loved one."]}, {"title": "Servicio de calidad en general", "summary": "El servicio brindado por el equipo fue catalogado como excelente y de constante amabilidad.", "evidence": ["Quality service.", "Excellent service", "Excellent customer service"]}, {"title": "Disfrute de servicios de masajes", "summary": "Se mencionó positivamente la experiencia en los servicios de masaje del spa.", "evidence": ["the massage services"]}, {"title": "Ambiente y equipamiento de la piscina", "summary": "La piscina fue percibida como amplia, limpia y con servicios destacados como bar húmedo y vistas.", "evidence": ["the relaxed atmosphere of the pool", "the pool which is huge, clean, with a wet bar and overlooking the sea.", "The super relaxing pool, ideal for disconnecting."]}, {"title": "Ubicación tranquila y conveniente", "summary": "La ubicación del hotel fue valorada como tranquila y con fácil acceso a zonas de interés y restauración, pese a estar alejado del centro histórico.", "evidence": ["The hotel is further away from the historic center but is in a super quiet region and close to a street where there are several bars/restaurants.", "a good location 👌"]}, {"title": "Desayuno satisfactorio y personal atento", "summary": "El desayuno recibió comentarios que resaltan tanto la calidad como la amabilidad del equipo de atención.", "evidence": ["The manha cafe is full and the attendants are kind.", "Tatiana and all the staff in the breakfast area very special and always pleasing their guests.", "Very good breakfast"]}, {"title": "Habitaciones limpias y espaciosas", "summary": "Se valoró positivamente la amplitud, limpieza y el equipamiento de las habitaciones.", "evidence": ["The apartments are spacious, clean, have coffee in capsule, sea view.", "The room was very clean and well maintained and prepared for a comfortable stay."]}, {"title": "Variedad de opciones gastronómicas internas", "summary": "Se apreció la oferta variada de restaurantes y bares dentro del propio hotel.", "evidence": ["The hotel is very complete, organized, has several restaurants and bars in its interior, making the tourist have everything very close."]}, {"title": "Apreciación de la carta y calidad culinaria", "summary": "Se resaltó la calidad de las opciones del menú y su capacidad para sorprender incluso a los paladares más exigentes.", "evidence": ["exquisite menu", "very good food, I don’t usually eat anything from the sea because I don’t like it and less the raw fish, which was just one of the dishes he presented me and I really have to say that it tasted good, even the texture, which is contradictory for me because I’m not used to it, I liked it.", "delicious food."]}, {"title": "Experiencias continuadas de