 contexto de la información concreta recibida.", "synchronizedUntil": "2026-07-08T15:34:00.383+00:00", "methodologicalNote": "Este informe resume los hallazgos derivados de la interpretación de 30 opiniones correspondientes al periodo señalado. La información expuesta refleja únicamente las observaciones de los huéspedes incluidas en la base documental analizada y su valoración final corresponde a la dirección del establecimiento. La cantidad y diversidad de la evidencia disponible condiciona el nivel de certeza y generalización posible sobre cada aspecto mencionado.", "positiveHighlights": [{"title": "Servicio personalizado y dedicado del personal", "summary": "Se resalta el esfuerzo y la atención especial del personal, quienes ofrecieron detalles únicos y mostraron una actitud servicial y cálida.", "evidence": ["the staff did their best to make us feel special. The surprise they prepared for us was something we will treasure forever: they made us feel that our celebration was unique and unforgettable. The attention of the whole team was impeccable: always attentive, with a genuine smile and willing to help in every detail."]}, {"title": "Experiencia gastronómica destacada en cenas y restaurantes", "summary": "Se reportan experiencias muy positivas tanto en la cena de aniversario como en los restaurantes, destacando la calidad culinaria, el ambiente y la atención.", "evidence": ["The dinner to celebrate our anniversary was just perfect. The decor they prepared was beautiful, with a detail that excited us a lot, and the evening itself was great, with careful attention and an atmosphere that made the night even more special.", "the restaurants offer five-star service", "I also enjoyed the original dishes at the La Bella Cubana restaurant", "We visited the restaurant La Bella Cubana, excellent service, especially the creations of Chef Jorge Ortiz; congratulations to him, he is the best."]}, {"title": "Experiencia global del huésped considerada sobresaliente", "summary": "Varios huéspedes describen su estancia como excepcional, memorable y digna de repetir.", "evidence": ["Our recent stay in Meliá Habana has undoubtedly been one of the best experiences we have had. ... It’s certainly a place we’ll come back to, because we take not only the memory of a perfect anniversary, but also the affection of a team that knows what true hospitality means.", "Spectacular. The best of vat certainly. 5 STARS ++", "My stay at the Meliá Habana was simply exceptional. Thank you to the whole team for making our visit an unforgettable experience. We definitely keep coming back and recommending!!!", "Without a doubt, a very good experience as a new customer, would repeat."]}, {"title": "Habitaciones espaciosas, limpias y confortables", "summary": "Se valoran positivamente la limpieza, comodidad, detalles especiales y vistas al mar en las habitaciones.", "evidence": ["The room we were assigned was absolutely beautiful, with details that made it spectacular and that further elevated the magic of our stay.", "The apartments are spacious, clean, have coffee in capsule, sea view.", "The room was very clean and well maintained and prepared for a comfortable stay."]}, {"title": "Estado y mantenimiento de las instalaciones y jardines", "summary": "Se destaca de forma positiva la elegancia, confort e impecable mantenimiento de las instalaciones y jardines.", "evidence": ["The facilities are impressive, with a perfect balance between elegance and comfort, and each space invites you to enjoy and relax.", "the facilities are impeccable", "a garden that gives the impression that we are in a park. Beautiful.", "Excellent facilities"]}, {"title": "Piscina amplia, limpia y ambiente relajante", "summary": "Se recibió feedback favorable sobre la piscina, su ambiente relajado, limpieza y servicios asociados.", "evidence": ["The pool was a success: a super relaxing space where we could disconnect and enjoy the surroundings with total tranquility.", "the relaxed atmosphere of the pool", "the pool which is huge, clean, with a wet bar and overlooking the sea.", "The super relaxing pool, ideal for disconnecting."]}, {"title": "Limpieza sobresaliente en habitaciones y áreas comunes", "summary": "Se elogió repetidamente la limpieza tanto de habitaciones como de zonas comunes y la dedicación del personal de limpieza.", "evidence": ["the maids leave the rooms sparkling", "pleasant and clean environment", "very clean everything, both common areas and room, cleaning"]}, {"title": "Atención profesional y cálida en recepción y gestión", "summary": "Diversos comentarios resaltan la amabilidad, profesionalidad y calidez del personal de recepción y responsables, quienes lograron que los huéspedes se sintieran como en familia.", "evidence": ["all the staff provide attentive service at the reception. The treatment is incredible; they make you feel like family all the time. Amparo at the reception was very attentive, always aware of all our needs, and with a smile, she was always ready to ensure we had a great stay.", "Very professional and warm treatment at the same time.", "Manager Negrin is always present to ensure everything is perfect and is a loved one."]}, {"title": "Calidad y variedad en los servicios gastronómicos", "summary": "Hay valoraciones positivas sobre la calidad del menú, el sabor de la comida y la atención en los desayunos.", "evidence": ["The food, on the other hand, was delicious; every bite was a pleasure and all the culinary attentions were up to the level of a first-rate service.", "exquisite menu", "very good food, I don’t usually eat anything from the sea because I don’t like it and less the raw fish, which was just one of the dishes he presented me and I really have to say that it tasted good, even the texture, which is contradictory for me because I’m not used to it, I liked it.", "delicious food."]}, {"title": "Ubicación apreciada por su tranquilidad y accesibilidad", "summary": "Algunos huéspedes destacan la ubicación por su tranquilidad y proximidad a zonas de interés, a pesar de estar alejado del centro histórico.", "evidence": ["The hotel is further away from the historic center but is in a super quiet region and close to a street where there are several bars/restaurants.", "a good location 👌"]}, {"title": "Oferta de servicios complementarios y comodidades", "summary": "El hotel cuenta con servicios como masajes y varios restaurantes/bar que aportan valor a la experiencia del huésped.", "evidence": ["the massage services", "The hotel is very complete, organized, has several restaurants and bars in its interior, making the tourist have everything very close.", "Yaima from the coffee shop 24/7."]}], "operationalPriorities": [{"title": "Atención en recepción: observación puntual sobre falta de amabilidad", "summary": "Se registró una opinión individual señalando que el personal de recepción no fue amable. Esta mención constituye una incidencia puntual y no se presentan más pruebas o comentarios similares en el período analizado.", "areaCode": "HOTEL_FRONT_OFFICE", "evidence": ["Sorry, not friendly"], "priority": "high", "causeCode": "HOTEL_FRONT_ATTENTION"}, {"title": "Estado de las instalaciones: comentario aislado sobre antigüedad", "summary": "Un huésped señaló que las instalaciones les parecieron antiguas. Este comentario es individual y no hay otras menciones directas al respecto en la evidencia analizada.", "areaCode": "HOTEL_FACILITIES", "evidence": ["old facilities"], "priority": "medium", "causeCode": null}, {"title": "Calidad de la comida: opinión puntual sobre inconsistencia", "summary": "Se recogió una observación individual respecto a la calidad algo inconsistente de la comida, identificada como 'skittish food'. No aparecen más menciones similares en la base de findings de este período.", "areaCode": "HOTEL_FOOD_BEVERAGE", "evidence": ["skittish food"], "priority": "medium", "causeCode": "HOTEL_FOOD_QUALITY"}]}	2026-08-25 15:56:34.177012+00
\.


