dings, events, beach trips, nights out, and special celebrations.\\n\\nCheck-in instructions emphasize notifying the host about late arrivals to ensure smooth entry and address potential lock malfunctions. Taylor stated that although he will arrive late (around 9:00 pm), his cousin will arrive at regular check-in time and has full access details. Guests are advised to report any home issues within two hours of check-in; minor damages like scratches or paint are not required to be reported. Essentials are stocked at the property, including toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, and dishwashing pods.\\n\\nAddress: 9720 SW 22nd St, Miami, FL, 33165\\n\\nCommunication highlights timely updates, hospitality readiness, and the host's readiness to accommodate and enhance guests' Miami stay.", "source_files_count": 13, "consolidation_error": null, "source_evidence_ids": [247, 248, 249, 250, 251, 252, 253, 254, 255, 256, 257, 258, 259], "classification_error": null, "consolidation_status": "COMPLETED", "manual_review_reason": null, "supports_guest_claim": null, "analysis_processed_at": null, "classification_status": "CLASSIFIED", "requires_manual_review": false, "supports_host_position": null, "contradicts_guest_review": null}], "disputability_analysis": {"confidence": 60, "risk_notes": ["Potential reputational risk to host if claims of false advertisement and unusable kitchen amenities remain unverified.", "Evidence weakness limits ability to definitively dispute the review.", "Host communication readiness noted but does not negate guest claims of listing inaccuracies."], "weaknesses": ["No direct evidence to support guest claims about bed type discrepancies or kitchen equipment issues.", "Lack of documented communication or photographic proof about kitchen limitations or food waste.", "No receipts or proof of external food orders due to kitchen problems."], "is_disputable": true, "main_arguments": ["Guest makes specific objective claims about false advertisement of bed ty